<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt 100 mln mark FRN/fixed bond.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt 100 mln mark FRN/fixed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate/fixed issue was announced by lead manager Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TRINKAUS &amp; BURKHARDT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   SPREAD     *	   MATURITY    25.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE    FRN/FIXED    BASE	12M LIBOR  PAY DATE    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.15    FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> NOTES	*REVERSE FRN 11.0 PCT LESS 12 MONTH LIBOR FOR YEARS</p>
<p>		 ONE TO FIVE, FIXED COUPON OF 7.50 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> LISTING    **	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	**DUESSELDORF REGULATED MARKET</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
